**LAYOUT PATTERN: Mobile-First Sidebar**

```css
/* Base (Mobile) */
.layout {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.header {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 10;
}

.sidebar {
  position: fixed;
  left: -100%;
  width: 80%;
  height: 100vh;
  transition: left 0.3s ease;
}

.sidebar.open {
  left: 0;
}

.main {
  padding: 1rem;
}

/* Tablet */
@media (min-width: 640px) {
  .sidebar {
    position: sticky;
    left: 0;
    width: 200px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .layout {
    flex-direction: row;
  }
}

/* Desktop */
@media (min-width: 1024px) {
  .sidebar {
    width: 250px;
  }
}
```

